    "name": "Company to URL API 🚨🚨🚨",
    "description": "- Endpoint: `GET /ctu3/api.{json|xml}` - discover domains from company names.\n- Example: `https://api.builtwith.com/ctu3/api.json?KEY=YOUR_KEY&COMPANY=Example`\n- Credits: 1 per lookup.\n\nSample response (`https://api.builtwith.com/samples/ctu_api_v3.json`):\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"Domain\": \"example.com\",\n    \"CompanyName\": \"Example\",\n    \"Spend\": 1024,\n    \"Country\": \"US\",\n    \"Socials\": [\"linkedin.com/company/example\"]\n  }\n]\n```\n\nUpdated 2026-11-10 from https://api.builtwith.com/llms-full.txt. Set KEY locally. Requests are examples; sending data requests may consume credits. Optional query parameters are disabled until selected.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
